Type: Package
Package: truckR
Title: Truck Routing and Bid Report Utilities
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Scott", "Jackson", email = "sjackson1997@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Driving distance and time for freight lanes with optional waypoints,
    using OpenRouteService (with saved answers and quota handling), plus
    helpers for PC*MILER API requests and for reading transportation bid
    reports.
